{"version":1,"content":"<p>張柏芝日前現身品牌活動，身穿簡約白色長裙優雅亮相，舉手投足間盡顯成熟女性的風采，獲不少圍觀粉絲讚嘆狀態超美，形容她是「白月光回來了」。</p><p>她在現場分享對生活品質的理解時坦言：「在忙碌之餘，懂得為自己留出片刻放鬆的時間，才是保持狀態的關鍵。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:39:12.716354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:59:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T21:17:32.618834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:37:36.047890+00:00","content_hash":"6473a067a831f6c04d3ba8a7a3fc0e0d9a76c8c57866e9ee4e9448265b5fca4d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}